  .bh__table_header p { color: #2A2A2A; font-family:'Trebuchet MS','Lucida Grande',Tahoma,sans-serif !important; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
</style><div class='beehiiv__body'><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/539d1b15-a7be-43b4-9d1d-fe49ac192b1c/ChatGPT_Image_Jul_21__2026__02_54_07_PM.png?t=1784671003"/></a></div><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://www.techrepublic.com/hubs/the-enterprise-guide-to-scalable-ai/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/4a9db815-0d70-4f09-914b-1ec1e6d5e3bd/In_Partnership_with_Dell_2.png?t=1774287533"/></a></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Welcome, humans. </p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">What if every hospital could give patients access to the world’s best surgeon, performing at their absolute best, every single day?</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">That is the long-term promise of autonomous surgery. But before you picture a robot rolling into the operating room alone, <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">our latest podcast episode</a> explains what the technology can do today, what remains science fiction, and why progress looks more like a ladder than a giant leap.</p><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9652e77b-46ad-48ee-b4a3-cc7c4987a411/TN_Thumbnail_MathiasUnberath.png?t=1784741608"/></a></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Grant sat down with <b>Mathias Unberath</b>, CTO and co-founder of <b>Inner Logic</b>, formerly Semaphor, and an award-winning computer vision and simulation researcher at Johns Hopkins Whiting School of Engineering. Inner Logic just announced an <b>$11.5M seed round</b> co-led by General Catalyst and Bison Ventures to build the simulation and validation infrastructure surgical autonomy will need before it reaches patients.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><i>No pressure. It only needs to work while someone is open on the table.</i></p><h1 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="heres-our-favorite-parts">Here’s our favorite parts:</h1><ul><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=1252&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">(20:52)</a> <b>The best surgeon on their best day:</b> Mathias explains how an autonomous system could capture elite surgical skill and reproduce it consistently across hospitals.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=1544&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">(25:44)</a> <b>The “we’re too squishy” problem:</b> Eyes and bones are relatively predictable. Livers, gallbladders, and other soft organs move and deform, forcing robots to adapt in real time.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=1747&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">(29:07)</a> <b>Robots fail in deeply unnatural ways:</b> A machine can enter a situation no surgeon would create, so developers must generate mistakes and recovery scenarios that barely exist in real-world training data.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=2021&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">(33:41)</a> <b>The stroke treatment that cannot wait:</b> Autonomous systems could bring specialized procedures to hospitals that lack the right expert when every minute affects a patient’s outcome.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=3160&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">(52:40)</a> <b>Surgery’s Waymo moment:</b> One robotic failure might become a viral story, even when the technology produces safer outcomes across the entire population.</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Why watch this?</b> The episode covers what “autonomous” really means to the uncomfortable questions that arrive once machines become better at certain surgical tasks than people.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">The conversation separates today’s robot-assisted surgery from the future vision of fully autonomous surgery. You will learn why autonomy is easier with bones than soft tissue, how robots learn from demonstrations, and where humans remain essential.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Watch and/or Listen now:</b> <b><a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">YouTube</a></b> | <b><a class="link" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0R3WK3LnWQbkfICwrYCbJl?si=a1DdRaCfSrGGwA91VhflDA&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Spotify</a></b> | <b><a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-neuron-ai-explained/id1742267001?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Apple Podcasts</a></b></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>P.S.</b> Jump to <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/yiQDaKIsZQE?feature=shared&t=1544&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">25:44</a> for Grant’s highly scientific explanation of the core challenge: <i>“We’re too squishy.”</i></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Keep scrolling for info on our upcoming livestream tomorrow and other recent episodes you’ll enjoy.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><i><b>Real quick:</b></i><i> Want to see your AI-adjacent product or service show up right here, below these podcast promos? Click the button below to advertise to our 700K+ readers! </i></p><div class="button" style="text-align:center;"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" class="button__link" style="" href="https://info.technologyadvice.com/advertise-with-the-neuron?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon"><span class="button__text" style=""><i>Advertise in The Neuron here!</i></span></a></div><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#E5E7EB;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/e3774230-5ffd-4020-b888-79c2eb10db1a/image.png?t=1762454392"/></div><p id="sponsored" class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>THIS EPISODE WAS BROUGHT TO YOU BY…</b></p><h1 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="sponsored">Your AI pilot worked. Now make it scale.</h1><div id="sponsored" class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://www.techrepublic.com/hubs/the-enterprise-guide-to-scalable-ai/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1ec6211a-6b7e-49e3-a9b3-56690b9b81ab/Dell_HubHero_042126__1___1_.jpg?t=1780900793"/></a></div><p id="sponsored" class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Plenty of companies can launch an AI pilot. Far fewer know how to make it stick. Explore this resource hub, sponsored by <a class="link" href="https://www.techrepublic.com/hubs/the-enterprise-guide-to-scalable-ai/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Dell AI Factory with NVIDIA</a>, for strategies, decisions, and real-world lessons on turning AI into something scalable, useful, and worth the investment.<br><br>Learn More: <a class="link" href="https://www.techrepublic.com/hubs/the-enterprise-guide-to-scalable-ai/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">The Enterprise Guide to Scalable AI</a></p><div id="sponsored" class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#E5E7EB;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/3666f51a-a274-4b89-b8d4-e183f8098b32/image.png?t=1763931733"/></div><h1 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="join-us-live-tomorrow-for">JOIN US LIVE TOMORROW FOR… </h1><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtube.com/live/yWTeravx6lM?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/152fcf51-f0c9-48fa-a0d7-64a2feb35a6b/Live_Thumbnail.png?t=1784672255"/></a><div class="image__source"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Click the image above to go to YouTube, then on YouTube, click “Notify Me” to get notified right when the stream starts</p></span></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Live Thursday, July 23 at 10:00 AM PT / 12:00 PM CT / 1:00 PM ET.</b></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Grant and Corey are <a class="link" href="https://youtube.com/live/yWTeravx6lM?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">going live</a> for a practical show-and-tell: the apps, games, extensions, writing systems, mini MMOs, and suspiciously specific tools they have built with AI over the past year and a half.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Corey is bringing Bean Counter, Tab Crusher, Threadline, Circle Back, and On Deck, his personal “what should I eat next?” machine. Grant is bringing FlowState, Orchestrator, LTX CineScript, Sqwirl World, and other experiments that began as tiny annoyances and somehow became real software.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Building something real is one of the fastest ways to learn what AI can actually do. You will see what worked, what broke, what burned too many tokens, and how non-technical builders can get from “this should exist” to a working thing people can use.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Also, the most important part: </b><i>we’ll share how we got them online so people can actually use them.</i></p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b><a class="link" href="https://youtube.com/live/yWTeravx6lM?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Open the live page and hit “Notify Me” to get notified when we begin.</a></b></p><div class="image"><img alt="" class="image__image" style="border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 0px 0px 0px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#E5E7EB;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/e3774230-5ffd-4020-b888-79c2eb10db1a/image.png?t=1762454392"/></div><h1 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="in-case-you-missed-it">🎙️ In Case You Missed It…</h1><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;">Four recent episodes worth checking out next:</p><h3 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="1-want-to-open-a-is-black-box-watch">1. Want to open AI’s black box? Watch: Inside the Hidden Geometry of AI</h3><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/rUWJrBDYF4c?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Inside the Hidden Geometry of AI episode thumbnail" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/00199073-2ee5-4dc0-a210-a0ba107206e4/maxresdefault.jpg?t=1784158221"/></a><div class="image__source"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Click to watch on YouTube.</p></span></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>TL;DW:</b> Corey Noles and Grant Harvey sit down with <b>Eric Ho</b>, Cofounder and CEO of <a class="link" href="https://www.goodfire.ai/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Goodfire</a>, to explore what is happening inside neural networks: features, circuits, confidence signals, neural geometry, and why AI may be less of a black box than it looks.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Why you should watch:</b> This is for anyone trying to understand how researchers might inspect, debug, steer, and intentionally design better AI systems instead of guessing what happens inside the model.</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>YouTube:</b> <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/rUWJrBDYF4c?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Watch Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Spotify:</b> <a class="link" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1qnOtWNjYkXYLCIiOkzZDd?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Apple Podcasts:</b> <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-neuron-ai-explained/id1742267001?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li></ul><h3 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="2-want-to-see-ai-leave-the-browser-">2. Want to see AI leave the browser? Watch: AI That Rides Along With Truck Drivers</h3><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/goL29De-EP4?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="AI That Rides Along With Truck Drivers episode thumbnail" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/5a26e628-725b-4657-ad27-c2a4df40a762/maxresdefault.jpg?t=1784159079"/></a><div class="image__source"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Click to watch on YouTube.</p></span></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>TL;DW:</b> <a class="link" href="https://www.samsara.com/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Samsara</a> Cofounder and CTO John Bicket explains how AI is moving into fleets, dash cams, dispatching, maintenance, and safety workflows across the physical world.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Why you should watch:</b> This is for anyone wondering what agents look like outside office software, where bad decisions can affect vehicles, workers, equipment, and real-world operations.</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>YouTube:</b> <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/goL29De-EP4?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Watch Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Spotify:</b> <a class="link" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/7ioSoyikmmd2YmStni2tx8?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Apple Podcasts:</b> <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/ai-that-rides-along-with-truck-drivers/id1742267001?i=1000776651940&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li></ul><h3 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="3-curious-what-serious-ai-art-workf">3. Curious what serious AI art workflows look like? Watch: ComfyUI Proves AI Art Is Not Zero Effort</h3><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/B_BL3k1LEy0?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="ComfyUI Proves AI Art Is Not Zero Effort episode thumbnail" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1c6c63e6-3ac5-4630-9afa-0cce1d31d296/maxresdefault.jpg?t=1784159079"/></a><div class="image__source"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Click to watch on YouTube.</p></span></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>TL;DW:</b> Yannik Marek, cofounder and original creator of <a class="link" href="https://comfy.org/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">ComfyUI</a>, explains how node-based workflows give creators control over models, parameters, memory, hardware, and repeatable visual production.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Why you should watch:</b> If prompt boxes make AI art feel like a slot machine, this shows the other side: visible pipelines, technical choices, iteration, and real creative intent.</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>YouTube:</b> <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/B_BL3k1LEy0?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Watch Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Spotify:</b> <a class="link" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/7krVsUurYUIOq6evGBfQ6p?si=pNU8HhK3Se2_qZUDAQVeLw&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Apple Podcasts:</b> <a class="link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/comfyui-proves-ai-art-is-not-zero-effort/id1742267001?i=1000776005803&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li></ul><h3 class="heading" style="text-align:left;" id="4-want-to-learn-how-open-ai-trains-">4. Want to learn how OpenAI trains agents to learn from experts? Watch: Can AI Agents Learn From Expert Corrections?</h3><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://youtu.be/ia9uY3NgEwA?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Can AI Agents Learn From Expert Corrections episode thumbnail" class="image__image" style="border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:2px;box-sizing:border-box;border-color:#d96d2e;" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7085e8fd-cb18-46c2-8889-903c946ca5c5/maxresdefault.jpg?t=1784159079"/></a><div class="image__source"><span class="image__source_text"><p>Click to watch on YouTube.</p></span></div></div><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>TL;DW:</b> <a class="link" href="https://openai.com/?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">OpenAI</a> engineers John de Wasseige and Arthur Fernandes Araujo explain how Tax AI turns accountant corrections into structured signals, evals, traces, and scoped product improvements.</p><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Why you should watch:</b> Do not let the word “tax” scare you off. This is an AI engineering masterclass on preserving evidence, handling edge cases, and building agents that improve through expert review.</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>YouTube:</b> <a class="link" href="https://youtu.be/ia9uY3NgEwA?utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Watch Here</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph" style="text-align:left;"><b>Spotify:</b> <a class="link" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/1PENuFhhJ38wTIvi8LpnKD?si=WrcPAKceQ3-1trSNqFRafQ&utm_source=www.theneurondaily.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=watch-would-you-trust-an-ai-surgeon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Listen Here</a></p></li><li><p c